WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.000
(Voice whispers) Mary!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.980
You brought shame on our family.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.480
There's something unnatural... (unclear speaking) Mary: NO!  (unclear speaking)

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.080
Jesus: Your family says you grapple with the demon.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.240
Mary: If there's a demon in me it's always been there.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.880
(Jesus takes a deep breath.)  There are no demons here.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.880
Mary of Mandala?

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:30.000
She'll do God's will.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.740
(Mary takes a deep breath.)

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.600
Why shouldn't she follow me?

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.400
People will judge us.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.060
I always heard you're different from men. You must teach us different things.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.240
(Jesus Laughs.)

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.620
Sometimes... it's as if I'm not here at all.

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.840
(Crowd excited.) woman: She can see.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.200
Is that what it feels like to be one with God?

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.040
No one has ever asked me how it feels.

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:01.160
The women are to afraid to be baptized with the men.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:04.060
Go to them. Be my hands.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.900
It's not right, that He has raised you up to lead us.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.800
You love my son don't you?

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:13.500
You must prepare yourself like me.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.540
Mary: For what?

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:17.960
To lose Him.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.880
(The crowd crys out.)

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:24.100
Jesus: God's kingdom is not to be bought and sold!

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.380
We need to take Him away from here.

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:30.420
What happens now is what God has asked of Him.

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:34.080
Mary, you are my witness.

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:43.720
Mary: I'll be with you, to the end.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:48.300
We'll never speak again, in His name.

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:51.720
The world will only change as we change.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.380
I will not be silent!

00:01:57.980 --> 00:01:58.860
I will be act.

